.TH FBLIVEAPP 1 "2026-09-10" "flux-tools 1.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fbliveapp \- live application installer for MiniOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fbliveapp
.I application_name
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fbliveapp
provides a localized interface for installing applications on MiniOS live systems. It supports multiple languages and provides application descriptions and installation commands.
.PP
After successful installation, the package launcher replaced by the Flux
shortcut is removed and the system MIME application cache is refreshed with
permissions that allow all users to read it, regardless of the caller's umask.
Service desktop files, including the MiniOS Store URI handler, are preserved.
An installation failure stops before launcher cleanup or application startup.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B vlc
Install or run VLC Video Player
.TP
.B firefox-esr
Install or run Firefox
.TP
.B minios-installer
Install or run MiniOS Installer through pkexec
.TP
.B minios-configurator
Install or run MiniOS Configurator through pkexec
.TP
.B minios-session-manager
Install or run MiniOS Session Manager
.TP
.B minios-kernel-manager
Install or run MiniOS Kernel Manager
.TP
.B minios-module-manager
Install or run MiniOS Module Manager
.TP
.B minios-image-builder
Install or run MiniOS Image Builder
.TP
.B minios-store
Install or run MiniOS Store
.TP
.B minios-help
Install or run MiniOS Help
.TP
.B driveutility
Install or run Drive Utility
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANG
Determines the language for application descriptions
